      "content": "but like i checked my pulse and it seems fine? and the swelling is just in one leg, it doesn't feel like an emergency. i'm sure if i just take a heavy dose of melatonin and get some sleep the tightness will go away. i'll just take like 10mg or something to make sure i crash. u think that's okay? i just really need to sleep this off.",
